0..77 Comment "//! A reflected truth-table check shows that three pigeons never sit one to a"
78..100 Comment "//! hole in two holes."
101..104 Comment "//!"
105..187 Comment "//! Boespflug, Dénès and Grégoire check the pigeonhole principle by a reflected"
188..264 Comment "//! decision procedure. A run of the procedure stands where a proof by cases"
265..275 Comment "//! would."
276..279 Comment "//!"
280..356 Comment "//! The formula makes each pigeon\'s place in each hole a variable. The check"
357..436 Comment "//! sets each variable both ways and evaluates the formula under all sixty-four"
437..453 Comment "//! assignments."
454..457 Comment "//!"
458..537 Comment "//! - cites: [Boespflug-2011-full_reduction_at_full_throttle], § 4, BDD, which"
538..587 Comment "//!   decides by binary decision diagrams instead"
588..626 Comment "//! - see: #2282 — the benchmark set"
627..630 Comment "//!"
631..797 Comment "//! [Boespflug-2011-full_reduction_at_full_throttle]: https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-25379-9_26 \"Boespflug, Dénès and Grégoire, Full Reduction at Full Throttle\""
